Acceptance Criteria
The task is complete when:
User can open the new module from the Vidya Jyothi menu.
User can select Academic Year 2026-27.
User can select State, District, and Mandal/Block.
Selecting KUMURAM BHEEM ASIFABAD and KOUTHALA shows relevant schools.
School grid includes UDISE code, school name, address, and status.
MPPS SANDGAON with UDISE 36021100201 can be selected.
Operational status displays in green.
Work areas and sub-components from the budget Excel are displayed.
User can select items and enter units/quantity.
Estimated amount is calculated for each item.
Work-area-wise subtotal is calculated.
Grand total estimated budget is calculated.
Final output includes school details, selected items, quantities, costs, budget total, estimated start date, and remarks.
Requirement/proposal can be saved or exported depending on existing app capabilities.
No Excel-specific logic is hard-coded into the UI; data should come from imported Excel-derived records.
Important Implementation Note
Represent all available Excel columns on the page or in the proposal output where applicable. Do not drop useful fields from the uploaded sheets. If column names differ from the assumed names above, map them dynamically and preserve the original column labels where possible.

